## 1. Executive Summary

The **Cloud Kitchen** platform has evolved from a traditional online ordering portal into an **enterprise-grade, end-to-end cloud kitchen operating system**. Recent core architectural enhancements span across two major subsystems:

1. **Centralized Raw Ingredient & Recipe Inventory System**: Eliminates manual stock tracking by linking raw grocery items (e.g., Paneer, Cheese, Butter, Vegetables) to menu items via a proportion-based **Recipe Matrix**. Fulfilling orders automatically deducts raw stock and triggers real-time out-of-stock guards across the customer menu catalog.
2. **Dedicated Driver Portal & OTP Verification System**: Introduces a mobile-first portal for delivery partners, integrated admin driver dispatch controls, real-time customer progress tracking with 4-digit OTP badges, and a secure digital handshake protocol to confirm order delivery.

