### 3.4 Automated Stock Deduction & Out-of-Stock Safeguard Engine

When an order status updates to `'Completed'` in [ManageOrders.aspx.vb](file:///d:/Cloud%20Kitchen/CLoud%20Kitchen%20Project/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Admin/ManageOrders.aspx.vb):

1. **`DeductInventoryForOrder(orderId)`** executes.
2. For each ordered dish:
   - Evaluates direct `m_unit_stock` or queries `Dish_Ingredients` for recipe component ratios.
   - Calculates exact raw ingredient deduction (`quantity × qty_required`) and updates `Ingredients`.
3. **Out-of-Stock Safeguard**: Checks if any ingredient stock reaches `0`. If true, automatically updates all linked menu items:
   ```sql
   UPDATE menu_item SET m_availability = 'No' WHERE m_id IN (SELECT DISTINCT m_id FROM Dish_Ingredients WHERE ingredient_id = @DepletedId)
   ```
4. Instantly disables ordering for those items on customer-side [Menu.aspx](file:///d:/Cloud%20Kitchen/CLoud%20Kitchen%20Project/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Customers/Menu.aspx).

