### 4.5 OTP Handshake & Delivery Completion Logic

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as 🧑‍🍳 Customer
    actor Driver as 🛵 Delivery Partner
    participant Portal as 📱 Mobile Driver Portal
    participant DB as 🗄️ SQL Server Database
    participant Email as 📧 Email Engine

    Driver->>Customer: Arrives with food package
    Customer-->>Driver: Provides 4-Digit OTP (e.g. 4892)
    Driver->>Portal: Enters OTP into verification input
    Portal->>DB: SELECT delivery_otp WHERE order_id = @OrderId
    alt OTP Matches
        DB-->>Portal: Valid OTP
        Portal->>DB: UPDATE Orders SET order_status='Completed', delivered_at=GETDATE()
        Portal->>DB: UPDATE Drivers SET driver_status='Available'
        Portal->>DB: Execute DeductInventoryForOrder(order_id)
        Portal->>Email: Send Order Completion Email
        Portal-->>Driver: ✅ Delivery Verified & Order Completed!
    else OTP Mismatch
        Portal-->>Driver: ❌ Invalid OTP Code. Please re-enter.
    end
```

